#: ../../user/features/code-completion.md:250
msgid "**`typr`** -- Record type definition"
msgstr "**`typr`** -- レコード型定義"

#: ../../user/features/code-completion.md:259
msgid ""
"The cursor stops at `name`, then `field`, then the field type, then "
